{title: Aake Teri Baahon Me}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F],        Aake teri baho me
[F],        Har sham lage sinduri
[F] [F#m],        Mere mann ko mahkaya
[Am] [F],        Tere mann ki kasturi
[Am] [F],        Mehki hawaye udata aachal
[Am] [F],        Lat ghugharale kale badal
[F],        Prem sudha naino se barase
[F],        Pi lene ko jivan tarase
[F],        Baho me dhas lene de
[F],        Prit ke chumban dene de
[F] [F#m],        In adharo se chhalak na jaye
[Am] [F],        Yauvan ras anguri
[Am] [F],        Sunderta ka bahata sagar
[Am] [F],        Tere liye hai rup ke badal
[F],        Indradhanush ke rang churau
[F],        Teri zulmi mang sajau
[F],        Do phulo ke khilane ka
[F],        Waqt yahi hai milane ka
[F] [F#m],        Aja milake aaj mita de
[Am] [F],        Thodi si ye duri
